<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Field Notes, an independent personal publication from Independent Lab.">
  <section class="about-grid"><h1>Made with attention.</h1><div class="about-copy"><p>Field Notes is what happens when a Gen-X person who lived through analog, the internet, social, mobile, and now AI suddenly gets his own publishing machine—and decides to use the damn thing.</p><p>It is an independent personal publication from Independent Lab: a home for Thinking, Work, Technology, Culture, Life, selected archive material, and experiments such as playX.</p><p>Written and built with curiosity, published when ready, and designed to make reading feel like the main event. No company, media startup, personal-brand machinery, trackers, subscriptions, or algorithms required.</p></div></section>
